"Mines" is an adaptation of an old computer game, where the objectis to determine where all the mines are located in a field. Clues aregiven by numbers in the field which indicate how many mines are adjacentto a particular space.C source is included for use with Microware Curses, as well as a compiledexecutable, using the OS9/68000 v2.35 cio trap handler for I/O. It ispossible that this program will run correctly under the TOP ncurses library,but that has not yet been tested.Enjoy, and please contribute more software to the growing library ofPD/SW/FSF OS9/68000 software!